          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 16:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I have set the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.16.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.16.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.16.8",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.16.8"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "always before me: because",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.16.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.16.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "he is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.16.8",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.16.8"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "at my right hand, I shall not be moved.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.16.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.16.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 16:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Therefore my heart is glad, and my glory rejoiceth: my flesh also shall rest in hope.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.16.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.16.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 16:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For thou wilt not leave my soul in hell; neither wilt thou suffer thine Holy One to see corruption.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.16.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.16.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 16:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Thou wilt shew me the path of life: in thy presence",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.16.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.16.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.16.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.16.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "fulness of joy; at thy right hand",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.16.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.16.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "there are",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.16.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.16.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "pleasures for evermore.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.16.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.16.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
